(6511713, 968540, 85430, '<td valign="top">Great capture. A tighter crop of the top portion would make this even better. Hey, i tried cropping out the other cyclist as well, would have been perfect.</td>', 'Great capture. A tighter crop of the top portion would make this even better. Hey, i tried cropping out the other cyclist as well, would have been perfect.', '2011-08-22 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
