(6511718, 968554, 85430, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Great shot. Your original photo better prove that he is a cyborg, or this one is a dnmc. Meanwhile, i will give you a 10.<br/> <br/>ETA: ok i just saw the COAST, so you get to keep the 10.</td>', 'Whoa! Great shot. Your original photo better prove that he is a cyborg, or this one is a dnmc. Meanwhile, i will give you a 10. ETA: ok i just saw the COAST, so you get to keep the 10.', '2011-08-22 02:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511747, 968535, 29777, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this shot is very positive. I love the HDR look of the wooden doors, the bricks, and the columns. However, there are technical details that bother me. The perspective is very obvious and the building appears to be falling back. The tops of the columns seem a little soft.</td>', 'My first impression of this shot is very positive. I love the HDR look of the wooden doors, the bricks, and the columns. However, there are technical details that bother me. The perspective is very obvious and the building appears to be falling back. The tops of the columns seem a little soft.', '2011-08-22 03:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511748, 968648, 29777, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2011-08-22 03:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511749, 968628, 29777, '<td valign="top">great moment</td>', 'great moment', '2011-08-22 03:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511750, 968135, 29777, '<td valign="top">This shot defines warm and fuzzy. The downside it that appears to be a "snapshot" against a white wall. The on-camera flash creates some harsh shadows behind and under the chin.</td>', 'This shot defines warm and fuzzy. The downside it that appears to be a "snapshot" against a white wall. The on-camera flash creates some harsh shadows behind and under the chin.', '2011-08-22 03:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
