(6511818, 968500, 63812, '<td valign="top">wow wow stunning image! 10</td>', 'wow wow stunning image! 10', '2011-08-22 05:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511830, 967635, 67258, '<td valign="top">A cool shot with lots of drama.  It may be an illusion, but it does appear to have the tiniest of leans towards the right, but a good entry.</td>', 'A cool shot with lots of drama.  It may be an illusion, but it does appear to have the tiniest of leans towards the right, but a good entry.', '2011-08-22 06:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511833, 968249, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have always wanted to try this, but never got around to it.  The reflection is very cool, but for the photograph to be truly successful, I feel it needs to be sharper.</td>', 'I have always wanted to try this, but never got around to it.  The reflection is very cool, but for the photograph to be truly successful, I feel it needs to be sharper.', '2011-08-22 06:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511834, 968523, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pleasing frame-filling shot, good textural detail and super eye-contact from the cheetah.  The composition may be straight in terms of actual horizon, but the cheetah appears to be trying to lean out of the frame - I wonder if a small anti clockwise rotation might help?</td>', 'Pleasing frame-filling shot, good textural detail and super eye-contact from the cheetah.  The composition may be straight in terms of actual horizon, but the cheetah appears to be trying to lean out of the frame - I wonder if a small anti clockwise rotation might help?', '2011-08-22 06:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511837, 968655, 67258, '<td valign="top">From a technical perspective, this seems ok, sharp and no blown highlights, although on my monitor there is room for more detail in the darks (not dinging you for that, as it may just be on mine), but why would you place a coin in a fir-cone?</td>', 'From a technical perspective, this seems ok, sharp and no blown highlights, although on my monitor there is room for more detail in the darks (not dinging you for that, as it may just be on mine), but why would you place a coin in a fir-cone?', '2011-08-22 06:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511839, 967973, 92577, '<td valign="top">stylish</td>', 'stylish', '2011-08-22 06:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511841, 968560, 92577, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2011-08-22 06:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511842, 968577, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  You have catured the insane vibrancy of cone-flowers well.  Stands out from the background perfectly, but with the background still providing context.</td>', 'Excellent!  You have catured the insane vibrancy of cone-flowers well.  Stands out from the background perfectly, but with the background still providing context.', '2011-08-22 06:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511843, 968547, 92577, '<td valign="top">A for effort</td>', 'A for effort', '2011-08-22 06:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511845, 967901, 67258, '<td valign="top">From a subjective point of view, much too overdone in the post-processing.  From a technical, issues with haloing around the buildings and excessive noise in some areas.  Composition is fine, although as presented the ultra bright red to the right dominates. A photo worth revisiting, I feel.</td>', 'From a subjective point of view, much too overdone in the post-processing.  From a technical, issues with haloing around the buildings and excessive noise in some areas.  Composition is fine, although as presented the ultra bright red to the right dominates. A photo worth revisiting, I feel.', '2011-08-22 06:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511846, 967969, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super graphic image - and what a wonderful place to enjoy a long cool drink!</td>', 'Super graphic image - and what a wonderful place to enjoy a long cool drink!', '2011-08-22 06:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511897, 968001, 47470, '<td valign="top">The sky and the water look so beautiful.  I just wish the beach was clean.</td>', 'The sky and the water look so beautiful.  I just wish the beach was clean.', '2011-08-22 09:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511899, 968654, 47470, '<td valign="top">This should be a lot sharper.  Adding a bit more depth of field to show some really nice condensation on the bottle would help.  I also don''t think the over-exposed background is very flattering to the subject.</td>', 'This should be a lot sharper.  Adding a bit more depth of field to show some really nice condensation on the bottle would help.  I also don''t think the over-exposed background is very flattering to the subject.', '2011-08-22 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511901, 967896, 47470, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to get a picture of someone eating that looks attractive.  Eating, for whatever reason, just never looks nice in a photograph.  On-camera flash doesn''t make this look appetizing either.</td>', 'It''s really hard to get a picture of someone eating that looks attractive.  Eating, for whatever reason, just never looks nice in a photograph.  On-camera flash doesn''t make this look appetizing either.', '2011-08-22 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511903, 967899, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the cloth is very appealing in this image.  I would have preferred something that looked more like a natural setting for a corkscrew, like a rich-looking table with a wine glass in the background.</td>', 'I don''t think the cloth is very appealing in this image.  I would have preferred something that looked more like a natural setting for a corkscrew, like a rich-looking table with a wine glass in the background.', '2011-08-22 09:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511904, 968658, 47470, '<td valign="top">Because of the strange perspective on this and the fact that it''s a reflection that allows some detail through, it was a bit difficult to figure out what this was at first.  If you were going for the abstraction, you definitely hit your mark.  if you weren''t, maybe you should have added a bit more context for the viewer.</td>', 'Because of the strange perspective on this and the fact that it''s a reflection that allows some detail through, it was a bit difficult to figure out what this was at first.  If you were going for the abstraction, you definitely hit your mark.  if you weren''t, maybe you should have added a bit more context for the viewer.', '2011-08-22 09:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511907, 968547, 10785, '<td valign="top">Move the man closer! And stop hurting all those trees!!!</td>', 'Move the man closer! And stop hurting all those trees!!!', '2011-08-22 09:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511911, 968501, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this looks like in black and white with a bit more contrast.  Very nicely captured.</td>', 'I wonder what this looks like in black and white with a bit more contrast.  Very nicely captured.', '2011-08-22 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511912, 968593, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think Rita is a pretty red heiffer! She has great hair! Just about the lighting... I think you have too much of Rita''s face in shadow. You needed to adjust your shooting angle to get the sun to be closer to 45 degrees from you and the cow. As it is, the sun is greater than 90 degrees putting it a little behind the cow''s face and putting too much of the face in shadow.</td>', 'I think Rita is a pretty red heiffer! She has great hair! Just about the lighting... I think you have too much of Rita''s face in shadow. You needed to adjust your shooting angle to get the sun to be closer to 45 degrees from you and the cow. As it is, the sun is greater than 90 degrees putting it a little behind the cow''s face and putting too much of the face in shadow.', '2011-08-22 09:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511913, 968152, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2011-08-22 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6511914, 968255, 47470, '<td valign="top">EASILY the best one in the challenge.  The processing on this is absolutely perfect and creates the most wonderful emotive scene.  The texture and the tones are gorgeous.  I''d love to know your processing steps on this.</td>', 'EASILY the best one in the challenge.  The processing on this is absolutely perfect and creates the most wonderful emotive scene.  The texture and the tones are gorgeous.  I''d love to know your processing steps on this.', '2011-08-22 09:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
