(6512839, 968547, 85430, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of effort went into the conceptualization of this shot. The colors and light work well for me, especially with the natural vignette. The printed eyes are symbolic and key to relaying the message you want to convey. Unfortunately, they did not work out quite well. Probably in another editing ruleset, you would have used something more effective than a printed graphic. As it is, i appreciate the conscious effort of executing an idea through your photography, rather than merely capturing a scene that is laid out in front of you. 9 from me.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of effort went into the conceptualization of this shot. The colors and light work well for me, especially with the natural vignette. The printed eyes are symbolic and key to relaying the message you want to convey. Unfortunately, they did not work out quite well. Probably in another editing ruleset, you would have used something more effective than a printed graphic. As it is, i appreciate the conscious effort of executing an idea through your photography, rather than merely capturing a scene that is laid out in front of you. 9 from me.', '2011-08-23 11:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
