(6514785, 967896, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity in the title. But I must confess that I dislike the image. Ribs should look appetizing, but in this shot they are just the opposite. I believe it''s a combination of the lighting (the main light is on your background, not your subject) and the focus point.</td>', 'I like the creativity in the title. But I must confess that I dislike the image. Ribs should look appetizing, but in this shot they are just the opposite. I believe it''s a combination of the lighting (the main light is on your background, not your subject) and the focus point.', '2011-08-24 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514787, 968657, 114225, '<td valign="top">The directed lighting adds drama to this image, but I feel if some of it could have been reflected back to her face to open the shadows on her left, it could have been a bit more pleasing.</td>', 'The directed lighting adds drama to this image, but I feel if some of it could have been reflected back to her face to open the shadows on her left, it could have been a bit more pleasing.', '2011-08-24 18:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
