(6515991, 968164, 108069, '<td valign="top">I spent the price of a small car for my wife and I to go on a whale-watching tour last month and we saw NO WHALES. Is this supposed to be funny? Do you think we like being mocked like this? Nice shot though.</td>', 'I spent the price of a small car for my wife and I to go on a whale-watching tour last month and we saw NO WHALES. Is this supposed to be funny? Do you think we like being mocked like this? Nice shot though.', '2011-08-25 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
