(6515998, 968255, 108069, '<td valign="top">Right. Well, I''m going to give it to you, because you can take it.<br/> <br/>You''ve got a sensational photo here. Stunning. But you somehow cocked up the horizon. Really? Also, the stones on the beach are so unsharp I''m sure this was hand-held, which is fine, of course.<br/> <br/>Tones and colors are awesome, as is composition. Well done.</td>', 'Right. Well, I''m going to give it to you, because you can take it. You''ve got a sensational photo here. Stunning. But you somehow cocked up the horizon. Really? Also, the stones on the beach are so unsharp I''m sure this was hand-held, which is fine, of course. Tones and colors are awesome, as is composition. Well done.', '2011-08-25 20:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
