(6517560, 968555, 137358, '<td valign="top">Lovely control of the B/W medium, nice crisp focus and depth<br/>there seems to be either two ariels or a couple of lines just comming up from the second car back which catch the eye a bit too much and irritate. A bit of cloning out might have helped here. otherwise lovely picture</td>', 'Lovely control of the B/W medium, nice crisp focus and depththere seems to be either two ariels or a couple of lines just comming up from the second car back which catch the eye a bit too much and irritate. A bit of cloning out might have helped here. otherwise lovely picture', '2011-08-27 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517563, 968469, 137358, '<td valign="top">a Lovely fresh image, with great shutter control. Love the fresh feeling this image gives. I can not give any critisism or hint to improve. well done</td>', 'a Lovely fresh image, with great shutter control. Love the fresh feeling this image gives. I can not give any critisism or hint to improve. well done', '2011-08-27 18:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517564, 967791, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice, well judged tone use. <br/>There is a loss of focus towards the rear of the greyhound, personaly I would have tried to get the whole of the hood ornament in focus, I know this is a bit of extra work but it does pay off.<br/>I love the concept and use of sepia.</td>', 'Nice, well judged tone use. There is a loss of focus towards the rear of the greyhound, personaly I would have tried to get the whole of the hood ornament in focus, I know this is a bit of extra work but it does pay off.I love the concept and use of sepia.', '2011-08-27 18:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517568, 968307, 137358, '<td valign="top">A lovely Autumnal feel to this image, I particularly like the use of 16/9. despite the well focused and lovely judjed saturation I think this image is too uniform. Funny to say with so much texture I know, but a basket, or a knife, something else to break up the uniformity would punch out the interest.<br/>for all that I love this image.</td>', 'A lovely Autumnal feel to this image, I particularly like the use of 16/9. despite the well focused and lovely judjed saturation I think this image is too uniform. Funny to say with so much texture I know, but a basket, or a knife, something else to break up the uniformity would punch out the interest.for all that I love this image.', '2011-08-27 18:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517570, 968648, 137358, '<td valign="top">HDR?<br/>Oversharpened?<br/>Nice image which has been proccessed to the point where it no longer looks like a photograph, more a painting. If this is the result you were after then well done. You can see that the origional image (s) was well focused and lovely control of depth. <br/>I dont know, it is striking. good luck in the challenge</td>', 'HDR?Oversharpened?Nice image which has been proccessed to the point where it no longer looks like a photograph, more a painting. If this is the result you were after then well done. You can see that the origional image (s) was well focused and lovely control of depth. I dont know, it is striking. good luck in the challenge', '2011-08-27 18:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517572, 968501, 137358, '<td valign="top">Good grief this has impact. So much so I can even forgive the small amount of soft focus on the main subject.<br/>Movement, drama, and a nice touch with the colour.<br/>Well done, and thanks for sharing</td>', 'Good grief this has impact. So much so I can even forgive the small amount of soft focus on the main subject.Movement, drama, and a nice touch with the colour.Well done, and thanks for sharing', '2011-08-27 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517574, 968326, 137358, '<td valign="top">You have perfectly captured this jump, there is movement, drama, intrest and a perfect controll of focus and depth.<br/>Some may say the subject should have been more central, do not listen, the siting gives motion to the overall.<br/>There is a little something just above the horses tail, an area I initially thought was blurred due to depth of field focus, but it may be camera or proccessing. It is the ONLY thing I found fault with in this image</td>', 'You have perfectly captured this jump, there is movement, drama, intrest and a perfect controll of focus and depth.Some may say the subject should have been more central, do not listen, the siting gives motion to the overall.There is a little something just above the horses tail, an area I initially thought was blurred due to depth of field focus, but it may be camera or proccessing. It is the ONLY thing I found fault with in this image', '2011-08-27 18:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517576, 968479, 137358, '<td valign="top">Fireworks, Night. They do so tempt the Photographer don''t they, and with good reason. this is a lovely image that has caught the celebratory nature of the event.<br/>Technicaly, I find the image a bit pink. toning down the warmth on saturation to darken the sky and water would punch out the city lights and fireworks. nice control of focus and depth.</td>', 'Fireworks, Night. They do so tempt the Photographer don''t they, and with good reason. this is a lovely image that has caught the celebratory nature of the event.Technicaly, I find the image a bit pink. toning down the warmth on saturation to darken the sky and water would punch out the city lights and fireworks. nice control of focus and depth.', '2011-08-27 18:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
