(6518936, 968302, 75713, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo of such an often photographed flower.  You have taken it to a higher level with your composition, focus and processing.  Beautifully done Alice.</td>', 'What an amazing photo of such an often photographed flower.  You have taken it to a higher level with your composition, focus and processing.  Beautifully done Alice.', '2011-08-29 01:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
