(6519587, 968500, 112972, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t run into Coyotes this late being out (by yourself?).  I noticed that the Coyotes in Yellowstone weren''t afraid of humans much.  There was one that started running towards me, I had to run to my car, open the door and dive into the car.  Same exact thing happened to some other guy while I was there.  He got out of his car to take a picture of a Coyote, the Coyote started to chase him, he had to get back to his car.  He had totally freaked out.  Congrats on your HM!</td>', 'I hope you didn''t run into Coyotes this late being out (by yourself?).  I noticed that the Coyotes in Yellowstone weren''t afraid of humans much.  There was one that started running towards me, I had to run to my car, open the door and dive into the car.  Same exact thing happened to some other guy while I was there.  He got out of his car to take a picture of a Coyote, the Coyote started to chase him, he had to get back to his car.  He had totally freaked out.  Congrats on your HM!', '2011-08-29 13:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
